WEBVTT

00:03:27.245 --> 00:03:30.414
we can help create
a better future for all.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.875
What does it look like?

00:03:32.917 --> 00:03:35.378
It looks like Indigenous Guardians.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:38.673
So, you've heard
of the "Guardians of the Galaxy?"

00:03:40.091 --> 00:03:45.054
Well, these guardians are doing a much
more important job right here on Earth,

00:03:45.096 --> 00:03:46.931
just without the soundtrack.

00:03:46.973 --> 00:03:48.849
(Laughter)

00:03:49.558 --> 00:03:53.980
Guardians are trained experts who work
on behalf of their Indigenous nations.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.108
They're our eyes and ears on the land.

00:03:57.566 --> 00:03:59.402
They monitor water quality,

00:03:59.402 --> 00:04:02.613
care for Indigenous-protected
and conserved areas,